      "area_ratio": 0.26019796807371026,
      "capacitance_ratio": 0.25,
      "evidence": "Fixed representative area sensitivity: q(1024)*phi(1024) from synthetic dendrites aggregates. Holding this ratio at all sizes and combining it with Brown\u2013Francis is a modelling scenario, not a habit-specific mass fit. Earth cloud aggregate relation; not validated for 0.15\u20130.60 m snow. No riming, crystal habit fractions or geometric scatter represented.",
